    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d288">

                <pb facs="0735" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v10/pg703"/>

                <head>288. Memorandum From the Officer in Charge of Cuban Affairs (Hurwitch) to the
                    Chief of Operations, Operation Mongoose (Lansdale)<anchor n="0" xml:id="d288-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1962-01-16">January 16,
                        1962</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Diplomatic, Political and Economic Action With Respect to Cuba</item>
                </list>
                <p>As requested at your meeting of January 12, 1962,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d288-f2"/>
                    there is attached a description of the principal causes of action in the
                    diplomatic, political <pb facs="0736" n="704" xml:id="pg704"/> and economic
                    fields with respect to Cuba which the Department of State is prepared to
                    undertake. While the Department will push ahead vigorously with this program
                    right after the OAS MFM,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d288-f3"/> further details with
                    respect to timing must await results of our initial efforts.</p>


                <xi:include href="d288-a1.xml" xpointer="d288-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d288-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d288-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, ARA/CCA Files: Lot 66 D 501, Gen. Agency Report.
                    Secret. Approved in ARA by Goodwin and Woodward.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d288-f2" n="1" xml:id="d288-f2-content">
                <p>No other record of this meeting has been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d288-f3" n="2" xml:id="d288-f3-content">
                <p>The reference is to the Eighth Meeting of Consultation of Ministers of Foreign
                    Affairs of the American Republics, held at Punta del Este, Uruguay, January
                    22-31, 1962. Documentation relating to this meeting, which focused on the
                    “Communist Offensive in America,” and led to the formal exclusion of Cuba from
                    participation in the Inter-American system, is printed in <ref
                        target="frus1961-63v12#pg_250">vol. XII, pp. 250</ref> ff. For text of the
                    Final Act, signed at the conclusion of the meeting on January 31, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">American Foreign Policy: Current Documents, 1962,
                        pp</hi>. 320-331.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
